                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Yoga vs running vs cycling — which category is most attractive?</h3>
                                        <p>Cycling for highest AOV + margin. Running for widest audience. Yoga for community depth + wellness overlap. Depends on your founder-market fit.</p>
                                        <h3>How important is athlete sponsorship?</h3>
                                        <p>Very. Sponsored athletes drive authenticity + content + community. Budget 2-5% of revenue on athlete + club sponsorship.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I compete with Lululemon / Rapha / Nike?</h3>
                                        <p>Not directly. Category niche + community depth + technical authority in a specific sub-category wins.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does specialty sportswear brand launch cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Serious launch: ₹40 lakh - 1.5 Cr ($48K-180K) initial. Category-defining brand: multi-year, ₹5-25 Cr ($600K-3M) cumulative.</p>
